'''December Gauntlet II''' (続・12月強襲！, ''Zoku・12 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''Continued・December Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during December and was added in the [[Version 11.0 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Christmas in Space (Monthly Event)|Christmas in Space]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
December Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''In Space Lvs''' (宇宙から Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a In Space Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[December Gauntlet II/In Space Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*December Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Christmas in Space (Monthly Event)|Christmas in Space]].

